{"author":{"id":"8d2e0405f08ac6c481f912544d6d5c0f58b2dc14a7e51ad4d499ee7a34567943"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794304602,"nonce":"Dx8FPLqjwaxQWewC80aHgiz9y7k=","title":"The adaptive loop has no estimator for Nedelec/RT fields and refuses periodic problems","message":"fem.solve(adapt=...) estimates and refines non-periodic native nodal-Lagrange fields only; a Nedelec or RT field raises by name (fem_adapt.py, the estimator and the DOF-budget paths), and periodic ties are excluded. Time-harmonic Maxwell cells (complex N1E with periodic or Bloch ties) therefore cannot be adapted. Needed: an H(curl) residual estimator (element residual of curl(mu^-1 curl E) - k0^2 eps E plus the tangential jumps of mu^-1 curl E across faces), and rebuilding the periodic reduction after each mesh change.","files":null}]}